- **Your prose is what the heading promises.** {{#if section_placement.whole}}This Leg is the whole Section.{{else}}{{#if section_placement.one_further}}1 further Leg continues under it, so open the question rather than closing it.{{else}}{{section_placement.further}} further Legs continue under it, so open the question rather than closing it.{{/if}}{{/if}}
{{else}}
- **This Leg CONTINUES the Section headed "{{section_placement.title}}".** That heading is already on the page, above prose you are writing further into.
- **No new heading is rendered here.** Develop what the Section has established; a new subject belongs to a Leg that opens its own.
